    "Refine RHBI to rhbi-v3 (parent rhbi-v2) under one unchanged global clock-free recipe: (1) set rhbi_conditional_fibre='slack' so continuous-conditioned critic tuples D(c, x) route singleton conditional fibres directly through fibre-centered paired relativistic log-odds F.softplus(D(c_i, x_real_i) - D(c_i, x_fake_i)) instead of collapsing conditional variance onto the conditional mean under 1-to-1 singleton-fibre W2 transport or diluting per-fibre slopes across unnormalized condition baselines b(c_i), while preserving 100% bit-for-bit identical joint Kantorovich-Hellinger Sinkhorn transport on all unconditional and discrete-class tasks; (2) disable batch-doubling concatenation inside RHBICriticPenalty when the passed critic view is an nn.Module carrying a batch-sized tensor attribute (e.g., trajectory and residual_student stateful slow-context closures) so endpoint Lipschitz caps evaluate cleanly without shape mismatches."
  ],
